# Competitive assessment of another vendor's product, kept locally for sizing work.
# Not ours to publish: this repo pushes to two remotes including arango-solutions,
# and prototypes/ is otherwise committed wholesale, so an untracked file here is one
# `git add -A` away from being published. Ignored rather than deleted so the sizing
# analysis stays available while the customer engagement is live.
prototypes/research.md

# `r2g forge generate` output. Every file carries a "Regenerate with: r2g forge
# generate" header — it is build product, not source, and committing it would put
# a stale copy of generated DDL under review alongside the generator that makes it.
forge-out/

# Transcript-mined pattern candidates awaiting /pattern-save triage. Local working
# state, not source: entries carry shell commands and absolute paths harvested from
# whatever this machine was doing, including unrelated repositories. `.claude/` and
# `.prd-drift-queue/` are ignored for the same reason.
.pattern-capture-queue/
